    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Beyond its charming arched entrance lies No. 40 Castlemoyne, an impressive four-bedroom semi detached family home which is beautifully positioned within this highly sought-after development. Upon arrival, you are immediately struck by the privacy and charm of this beautiful home. \r\n\r\nThe property briefly comprises of a bright and welcoming entrance hall, guest WC, spacious open-plan kitchen and dining area with patio doors opening directly onto the rear garden and a separate utility room. The generously proportioned lounge is a particular highlight, featuring a stunning bay window that floods the room with natural light.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the property continues to impress offering four spacious double bedrooms with the master bedroom benefiting from a private en-suite. A large family bathroom completes the accommodation, while the bright and airy landing features a versatile comfort zone, providing the perfect space for a reading area or quiet time."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hall  \t5.56 x 1.96\tAmerican walnut timber floor, coving, light fitting, bright & airy\r\n\r\nGuest WC\t1.32 x 1.6  Tiled floor, wc, whb, holders\r\n\r\nLounge        (into bay)\t4.35 X 6.8\tAmerican walnut timber floor, Surround sound system, open fireplace with marble surround, built in shelving, abundance of natural light.\r\n\r\nDining area \t4.45 x 3.36\tDecorative timber floor, built in display unit, sliding door to rear garden\r\n\r\nKitchen\t6.0 x 2.63\tTiled floor, abundance of fitted units, gas stove, oven, extractor fan, dishwasher, American fridge / freezer, feature brick backsplash, sliding door to rear garden\r\n\r\nUtility\t\tTiled floor, plumbed for washer / dryer\r\n\r\nStairs / Landing\t\tComfort Zone, bright & airy, stira access to attic, large hot press\r\n\t\t\r\nBedroom 1\t2.4 x 2.65\tDecorative timber floor, fitted mirrored wardrobe\r\n\t\t\r\nBedroom 2\t4.95 x 2.60\tDecorative timber floor, fitted wardrobe\r\n\t\t\r\nBedroom 3\t3.9 x 3.87\tDecorative timber floor, fitted wardrobe, overlooking green space\r\n\t\t\r\nBathroom\t2.37 x 2.05\tTiled floor, part tiled wall, w.c., w.h.b., mirror, bath suite, feature over hanging shower head, shower screen\r\n\r\nBedroom 4\t4.34 x 3.35\tFitted wardrobes, tv point\r\n\r\nEn Suite\t1.5 x 1.85\tTiled floor & partial tiled walls, cabinet, mirror, wc, whb, walk in shower\r\n\r\nFront Garden         Beautiful arch entrance, private wraparound garden, greenhouse, hedging\r\n\r\nRear Garden          Mature garden, various patio, raised bedding, walled & fenced, tap, light"
